{title: God of the Sparrow}
{key: C}
{time: 3/4}
{meta: tune ROEDER}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]God of the [Em]sparrow, [Am]God of the [Dm]whale, [G]God of the [C]swirling [F]stars[E7]
[Am]How does the [Em]creature say [Dm]Awe[C], [Am]how does the [Dm]creature say [C]Praise[G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]God of the [Em]earthquake, [Am]God of the [Dm]storm, [G]God of the [C]trumpet [F]blast[E7]
[Am]How does the [Em]creature cry [Dm]Woe[C], [Am]how does the [Dm]creature cry [C]Save[G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]God of the [Em]rainbow, [Am]God of the [Dm]cross, [G]God of the [C]empty [F]grave[E7]
[Am]How does the [Em]creature say [Dm]Grace[C], [Am]how does the [Dm]creature say [C]Thanks[G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C]God of the [Em]hungry, [Am]God of the [Dm]sick, [G]God of the [C]prodi[F]gal[E7]
[Am]How does the [Em]creature say [Dm]Care[C], [Am]how does the [Dm]creature say [C]Life[G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 5}
[C]God of the [Em]neighbour, [Am]God of the [Dm]foe, [G]God of the [C]pruning [F]hook[E7]
[Am]How does the [Em]creature say [Dm]Love[C], [Am]how does the [Dm]creature say [C]Peace[G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 6}
[C]God of the [Em]ages, [Am]God near at [Dm]hand, [G]God of the [C]loving [F]heart[E7]
[Am]How do your [Em]children say [Dm]Joy[C], [Am]how do your [Dm]children say [C]Home[G]
{end_of_verse}
